WEBVTT

00:07.985 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:50.825 --> 01:51.665
Why you?

01:52.785 --> 01:54.905
Zhao Heng got stuck in a meeting.

01:54.985 --> 01:57.665
The documents are too important.
I feel better picking them up myself.

01:57.745 --> 01:58.985
Go get them for me.

02:00.785 --> 02:01.825
Me?

02:01.905 --> 02:03.225
Take my advice.

02:03.305 --> 02:06.945
She'll be back in a few months
after she has the baby.

02:07.025 --> 02:10.425
And when she comes back,
she'll still be above you.

02:10.505 --> 02:12.705
It's better to make peace
than to hold a grudge.

02:14.385 --> 02:15.825
I wasn't around when you took leave.

02:15.905 --> 02:17.825
You're my mentor.
I thought I'd come to see you.

02:19.625 --> 02:22.105
If your expression were more sincere,
I might actually believe you.

02:24.105 --> 02:25.345
I'm not here to kick you
while you're down.

02:26.865 --> 02:28.305
I don't care. Business is business.

02:30.585 --> 02:32.425
Everything's here. Count them.

02:51.665 --> 02:53.585
Seems like we're missing
one database key USB drive.

02:55.425 --> 02:56.745
Wait here. I'll get it.

03:15.985 --> 03:17.065
Zhiwen,

03:17.145 --> 03:18.585
I dropped something in the couch cushions.

03:18.665 --> 03:19.945
Can you get it for me?

03:21.905 --> 03:22.785
I'm talking to you.

03:23.385 --> 03:24.985
Coming. Let me finish this round.

03:26.225 --> 03:27.745
My colleague is waiting at the door.

03:27.825 --> 03:29.705
Just get it for me.
Get it and make her leave.

03:30.425 --> 03:31.665
Stop rushing me!

03:31.745 --> 03:33.185
I said I'll go after this round.

03:35.545 --> 03:36.705
Fine. I'll wait.

03:36.785 --> 03:37.905
Help me when you're done.

04:07.945 --> 04:08.945
Are you crazy?

04:09.025 --> 04:09.905
I am crazy!

04:10.985 --> 04:12.105
Get away!

04:13.505 --> 04:15.305
-Are you okay?
-Don't touch me.

04:23.945 --> 04:24.945
Are you alright?

04:25.465 --> 04:27.185
Let… Let me help you up.

04:30.105 --> 04:31.825
What are you doing? Come help!

04:31.905 --> 04:33.505
Hurry up. The floor is cold.

04:35.265 --> 04:38.745
You're always like this. A little bump
and you act like you're dying.

04:42.145 --> 04:43.385
Are you okay?

04:43.465 --> 04:45.265
Don't worry. She's fine.

04:45.345 --> 04:46.865
I'm used to it.

04:57.785 --> 04:59.025
You…

05:02.185 --> 05:04.025
I'll call an ambulance.

05:07.105 --> 05:08.065
Ms. Lin, hang in there.

05:34.425 --> 05:36.025
NOTICE OF SURGERY

05:38.345 --> 05:40.865
FETAL HEARTBEAT NO LONGER DETECTABLE

05:42.545 --> 05:46.265
I've already taken care
of the paperwork. The baby?

05:46.785 --> 05:48.105
How's the baby?

05:53.305 --> 05:54.225
Tell me.

05:55.185 --> 05:56.225
Zhiwen.

05:56.825 --> 05:58.065
The baby…

06:04.505 --> 06:05.505
I'm sorry.

06:06.025 --> 06:07.105
It's all my fault.

06:08.345 --> 06:09.665
I'm the worst.

06:10.185 --> 06:11.225
I…

06:15.305 --> 06:16.225
It's okay.

06:17.545 --> 06:19.025
I know you didn't mean it.

06:35.265 --> 06:37.025
FIVE MINUTES AGO

06:37.105 --> 06:37.985
Thanks.

06:38.065 --> 06:39.185
It's alright.

06:42.385 --> 06:43.545
I owe you one.

06:45.065 --> 06:47.465
It's got nothing to do with you.
I made my own choices.

06:49.585 --> 06:51.265
Back at your place just now…

06:53.425 --> 06:55.065
Are you done yet?

06:55.145 --> 06:56.985
Don't go too far!

07:00.105 --> 07:01.025
What is wrong with you?

07:01.105 --> 07:03.105
So clumsy. Falling on flat ground?

07:06.425 --> 07:07.305
Don't worry.

07:08.305 --> 07:09.785
We don't have cameras at home.

07:10.665 --> 07:12.745
He fell on his own.

07:14.425 --> 07:15.265
But thank you.

07:16.305 --> 07:17.345
And

07:17.425 --> 07:19.345
for everything I did to you before,

07:19.425 --> 07:20.425
I'm sorry.

07:20.505 --> 07:22.625
I don't remember
anything that happened before.

07:24.505 --> 07:25.465
Alright.

07:28.705 --> 07:29.745
Then I don't remember either.

07:31.225 --> 07:32.825
Is there anything else you need?

07:33.585 --> 07:34.625
Don't move.

07:52.665 --> 07:53.505
It's all my fault.

07:53.585 --> 07:55.305
I was too reckless.

07:55.385 --> 07:57.465
I used too much force.

07:58.065 --> 08:00.225
I really didn't know you were hurt.

08:00.305 --> 08:01.625
I've been the one at fault before.

08:02.145 --> 08:03.825
I didn't consider your feelings.

08:04.545 --> 08:08.345
Ms. Huang, this recording
proves at least three things.

08:09.105 --> 08:09.945
First,

08:10.025 --> 08:11.665
Jiang Zhiwen had been
indifferent to me for a long time

08:11.745 --> 08:13.385
before my delivery.

08:13.465 --> 08:15.385
Jiang Zhiwen, don't leave!
Come back here and explain yourself!

08:16.105 --> 08:18.865
Are you trying to drive me
to divorce you with this cold treatment?

08:18.945 --> 08:20.865
Don't keep using divorce as a weapon.

08:25.145 --> 08:27.545
Second, the main cause of my miscarriage

08:27.625 --> 08:29.985
was him pushing me down in anger.

08:30.985 --> 08:31.985
Third,

08:32.065 --> 08:34.664
the money he transferred
to his parents for the apartment

08:34.745 --> 08:37.065
was a loan, not a gift.

08:37.784 --> 08:41.185
You didn't even discuss it with me
before lending that much money to someone?

08:41.985 --> 08:42.825
Someone?

08:42.904 --> 08:44.585
They're my parents!

08:44.665 --> 08:46.105
You have a very clear head,

08:46.185 --> 08:49.345
but I suggest you wait
until you've fully recovered

08:49.425 --> 08:50.425
before pursuing these matters.

08:53.025 --> 08:55.505
Ms. Huang, you have to believe me.

08:56.105 --> 08:58.425
I'm clearer-headed now
than I've ever been.

08:59.465 --> 09:03.385
I will never regret this divorce.

09:05.505 --> 09:07.745
Oh my, she really said that?

09:08.265 --> 09:09.145
Yeah.

09:09.225 --> 09:10.825
From the moment she came out of surgery,

09:10.905 --> 09:12.145
it was like she turned back

09:12.225 --> 09:14.505
into the Ms. Lin I knew
when I first joined the company.

09:14.585 --> 09:19.105
Sound logic, clear purpose,
sharp thinking, and decisive action.

09:19.905 --> 09:23.425
You seem to be feeling sympathy for her
because of her pain.

09:25.665 --> 09:28.745
I just think it's hard to truly know

09:28.825 --> 09:30.505
what's going on in someone's life
behind the scenes.

09:31.265 --> 09:33.505
And at that moment, only I could help her.

09:34.505 --> 09:36.065
You would've done the same.

09:36.825 --> 09:38.465
You know what?
I used to think induced labor

09:38.545 --> 09:39.745
was like what they show on TV.

09:39.825 --> 09:42.025
You get anesthesia and wake up fine.

09:42.105 --> 09:43.385
But it's not like that at all.

09:44.305 --> 09:47.385
Even with a pain pump,
you still throw up bile

09:47.465 --> 09:49.185
from the dizziness and nausea.

09:49.265 --> 09:50.585
And after the procedure,

09:50.665 --> 09:54.025
someone has to press hard on your belly
to clear everything out.

09:54.665 --> 09:56.065
Lin Long is really tough.

09:56.145 --> 09:58.185
She didn't make a sound
the whole way to the hospital.

09:58.785 --> 10:02.105
But I could hear her crying
from outside the door.

10:03.865 --> 10:06.345
No, not crying. She was wailing.

10:07.505 --> 10:08.825
Okay. Stop saying that.

10:11.785 --> 10:13.105
Let's talk about something else.

10:13.905 --> 10:15.745
When are you closing
the Ande Energy project?

10:16.785 --> 10:18.425
-Probably this week.
-Congratulations.

10:19.025 --> 10:20.225
You have to treat everyone to a meal.

10:20.305 --> 10:22.145
Can we do it after I get back
from Macao, China?

10:22.665 --> 10:23.945
What's there to congratulate?

10:24.545 --> 10:27.225
My dad doesn't even care
about this little deal.

10:27.305 --> 10:29.665
What does your dad have to do with it?

10:29.745 --> 10:32.185
This is the first contract
that you won on your own merit.

10:32.265 --> 10:34.345
We can't control
whether others value it or not,

10:34.425 --> 10:36.265
but we should still celebrate ourselves.

10:37.265 --> 10:38.105
Makes sense.

10:39.945 --> 10:42.065
Aren't you working
on the Bolo Culture project?

10:42.145 --> 10:43.265
Why are you going to Macao, China?

10:43.345 --> 10:45.625
Bolo Culture is expanding
their IP overseas.

10:45.705 --> 10:48.105
They're negotiating with a company there
about the European market.

10:48.625 --> 10:49.865
Plus,

10:50.465 --> 10:51.465
I have some personal business.

10:53.865 --> 10:54.945
Personal business?

11:07.025 --> 11:09.545
Adjust your stride.
Control your breathing.

11:09.625 --> 11:12.465
Exercise is the best way
to reset your energy.

11:13.785 --> 11:16.905
Men usually talk a better game
than they can actually deliver.

11:17.705 --> 11:19.625
Let's race the 4x10-meter shuttle run.

11:38.785 --> 11:39.905
I give up.

11:40.865 --> 11:41.945
Oh,

11:42.705 --> 11:44.425
send me your flight number
to Macao, China.

11:44.945 --> 11:46.225
I'll upgrade your seat.

11:47.625 --> 11:49.625
It's free. Courtesy of Tianhe.

11:50.705 --> 11:52.785
I need to brief you

11:53.305 --> 11:55.505
on the Digital Finance Forum
while we're on the plane.

11:55.585 --> 11:56.985
If you're in economy,
how am I supposed to do that?

11:57.785 --> 11:59.785
Even though the forum
is in Macao, China, too,

11:59.865 --> 12:02.225
if I come to you on a work trip,

12:02.305 --> 12:04.945
won't it look like
I'm using company resources?

12:05.025 --> 12:06.065
What if people gossip?

12:06.145 --> 12:08.505
You're not attending the whole forum.

12:08.585 --> 12:09.945
It's completely normal
to bring a date to a party.

12:10.825 --> 12:12.145
If you can't manage this much,

12:12.225 --> 12:13.625
how are you going to be my right hand?

12:15.145 --> 12:16.305
Remember to bring a black dress.

12:16.385 --> 12:19.505
Safe and foolproof for business occasions.

12:22.785 --> 12:25.825
MACAO, CHINA

12:30.905 --> 12:32.505
Is this the kind of black dress you meant?

12:33.425 --> 12:34.905
Nice.

12:34.985 --> 12:36.185
Where did you get this outfit?

12:36.265 --> 12:37.225
Pretty fresh and elegant.

12:38.825 --> 12:40.945
According to the invitation,
the dress code

12:41.025 --> 12:42.385
is business formal.

12:42.465 --> 12:44.745
I don't know much about this,
so I looked it up online.

12:44.825 --> 12:48.305
The blogger says for business formal,
guys need black ties,

12:48.385 --> 12:50.225
and women need knee-length dresses,

12:50.305 --> 12:52.785
fancy jewelry, and evening clutches.

12:52.865 --> 12:55.945
So I rushed to rent
the dress and necklace.

12:56.025 --> 12:57.905
I put down a credit card as a deposit,
and it wasn't cheap.

12:59.265 --> 13:01.945
You know what?
That blogger was pretty spot on.

13:02.545 --> 13:04.945
But for an occasion like today,

13:05.025 --> 13:06.185
we usually dress a bit more casually.

13:06.265 --> 13:08.105
Especially in the tech industry.

13:08.185 --> 13:09.705
Otherwise, it looks like
you're trying too hard.

13:10.745 --> 13:11.705
You look great.

13:11.785 --> 13:12.985
Just a little overdone.

13:19.865 --> 13:21.065
I see.

13:27.985 --> 13:28.905
Perfect.

13:37.585 --> 13:41.625
GOLDEN BAY AREA DIGITAL FINANCE
AND INDUSTRY EMPOWERMENT SUMMIT

14:12.705 --> 14:15.145
Do you go to these cocktail parties often?

14:15.665 --> 14:17.985
I noticed you guys
just exchanged simple greetings

14:18.065 --> 14:20.745
and chatted about diving and kayaking.

14:21.545 --> 14:24.265
How does that kind of
casual acquaintance help with work?

14:24.345 --> 14:25.945
For a client,

14:26.025 --> 14:28.545
they instinctively trust
that someone with higher income

14:28.625 --> 14:31.145
understands their investment needs
and financial risks better.

14:31.825 --> 14:33.105
Same goes for business partnerships.

14:33.185 --> 14:35.425
Most deals are built on trust,

14:35.505 --> 14:36.865
not capability.

14:36.945 --> 14:39.865
And trust takes time
and repeated interactions to build.

14:39.945 --> 14:41.865
Once you get used to this circle,

14:41.945 --> 14:44.425
opportunities will naturally
open up for you.

14:44.505 --> 14:45.785
Get used to this circle?

14:46.985 --> 14:49.265
Are you planning to do
digital asset projects in the future?

14:50.385 --> 14:53.545
You know why the consulting industry
has been shrinking these past few years,

14:53.625 --> 14:57.505
yet C&amp;C still manages to beat out
high-and-mighty foreign firms like yours?

15:00.585 --> 15:03.745
Because those old-school consulting tricks
are all over the internet now.

15:04.665 --> 15:07.185
And I've always insisted on staying close
to the front lines of real industries.

15:07.265 --> 15:10.505
That way, I can offer clients
strategic advice with real substance.

15:11.745 --> 15:14.305
Otherwise, even if we fool
some clueless rich folks now,

15:14.825 --> 15:17.025
the times will eventually leave us behind.

15:18.425 --> 15:22.345
So that's why you briefly
left Boen to work at P&amp;J?

15:22.425 --> 15:25.865
Actually, even though
P&amp;J is an FMCG giant,

15:25.945 --> 15:28.465
their consulting budget
has been shrinking year after year.

15:30.465 --> 15:33.905
Just because these emerging
tech companies spend big,

15:33.985 --> 15:35.105
you…

15:35.185 --> 15:36.385
What is a consultant's mission?

15:37.145 --> 15:38.825
To improve the world's
management standards?

15:38.905 --> 15:39.865
No.

15:39.945 --> 15:41.265
It's to get orders.

15:41.345 --> 15:42.425
Orders are what matter.

15:43.065 --> 15:44.705
Consultants can't know every industry.

15:44.785 --> 15:48.945
Even a genius can only master
three to four business domains at most.

15:49.625 --> 15:50.945
When choosing industries,

15:51.025 --> 15:52.985
you have to find ones
with money and orders.

15:53.985 --> 15:57.585
I've done internships in FMCG,
logistics, and manufacturing.

15:57.665 --> 15:58.865
You want the truth?

15:59.745 --> 16:02.425
If your first project
wasn't an internet unicorn

16:02.505 --> 16:04.425
like Bolo Culture,

16:05.745 --> 16:06.825
you wouldn't be standing here.

16:11.345 --> 16:14.065
Ever since the interview,
every time you talk about work,

16:14.145 --> 16:15.825
your style is brutally direct.

16:17.905 --> 16:19.985
Playing with kids
and training subordinates

16:20.065 --> 16:20.905
are completely different things.

16:28.865 --> 16:30.585
Welcome to the real world.

16:52.345 --> 16:54.465
You brought your little junior here?

16:55.385 --> 16:57.425
See? She's already overwhelmed.

16:58.105 --> 17:01.345
We're not at the same company,
and we don't get much time together.

17:01.945 --> 17:05.424
I brought her here
to see if she's our kind of person.

17:05.505 --> 17:08.184
She's a blank slate right now.

17:08.265 --> 17:09.625
It's good for you to show her
more of the world.

17:10.825 --> 17:11.665
Like…

17:15.785 --> 17:16.825
Look.

17:30.865 --> 17:31.705
An old friend of mine just showed up.

17:33.025 --> 17:34.065
Come with me to say hi.

17:35.585 --> 17:36.545
Okay.

17:36.625 --> 17:37.905
How's your current project going?

17:38.665 --> 17:40.545
-Long time no see.
-Xinzhi.

17:41.225 --> 17:42.545
-You're here too?
-You're here too.

17:42.625 --> 17:43.705
-What a coincidence.
-Small world.

17:43.785 --> 17:46.145
Xu Chi, let me introduce you to a legend.

17:46.225 --> 17:49.145
He's my former mentor,
Wen Ruosen, a partner at Boen.

17:49.745 --> 17:51.465
Hello. I'm Xu Chi.

17:51.545 --> 17:52.785
Nice to meet you, Miss Xu.

17:52.865 --> 17:54.385
Is Miss Xu in consulting?

17:54.465 --> 17:55.545
-Yes.
-Let me warn you.

17:55.625 --> 17:57.985
Be careful with this guy.
He's got a silver tongue.

17:58.065 --> 17:59.865
Don't fall for his tricks.

18:01.345 --> 18:03.545
Actually, I've already left the industry.

18:03.625 --> 18:05.745
I'm incubating my own projects now.

18:05.825 --> 18:07.425
Oh, let me introduce you.

18:07.505 --> 18:09.705
This is the CEO
of Benyuan Digital Collectibles.

18:09.785 --> 18:11.025
Benyuan is the largest

18:11.105 --> 18:12.465
digital collectibles platform
in Hong Kong, China.

18:12.545 --> 18:13.745
I know.

18:13.825 --> 18:15.905
I actually collected
a Yifubao red-envelope skin featuring

18:15.985 --> 18:17.145
the Northern Wei Grottoes a few days ago.

18:17.225 --> 18:18.585
I'm quite interested in this area.

18:18.665 --> 18:19.625
I would love to learn more.

18:24.025 --> 18:26.385
Hello. I'm Tang Yisheng, Tommy.

18:26.465 --> 18:28.785
Sorry. My Mandarin isn't very good.

18:28.865 --> 18:31.105
My Cantonese isn't all that good either.

18:32.105 --> 18:33.025
We can chat more in the future.

18:33.105 --> 18:34.945
Sure. Come on. Cheers.

18:35.025 --> 18:36.265
-Come on.
-Cheers.

18:36.345 --> 18:37.465
-Cheers.
-Come on.

18:37.545 --> 18:38.585
Pleasure.

19:00.665 --> 19:01.505
Tired?

19:02.625 --> 19:03.545
Not really.

19:09.505 --> 19:11.985
I noted down the key points

19:12.065 --> 19:13.425
from Wen Ruosen
and Mr. Tang's private conversation

19:13.505 --> 19:14.545
in Cantonese.

19:14.625 --> 19:16.425
I'm sending it to you in case I forget.

19:16.505 --> 19:18.825
Wen Ruosen has a lot of connections
in the art world.

19:18.905 --> 19:21.665
He runs a digital collectibles agency,

19:21.745 --> 19:24.585
kind of like a gallery,
called Yuanzhou Gallery.

19:24.665 --> 19:27.625
They want to partner with Mr. Tang's
collectibles platform in Hong Kong, China.

19:29.145 --> 19:30.425
You speak Cantonese?

19:31.825 --> 19:33.105
My high school teacher,

19:33.185 --> 19:35.225
who looked after me growing up,
is from Guangdong.

19:36.945 --> 19:38.825
Secretly gathering business intelligence?

19:39.865 --> 19:41.225
Nice one, Chi.

19:41.825 --> 19:42.905
Nothing much.

19:42.985 --> 19:45.945
You were just talking
about digital assets nonstop,

19:46.025 --> 19:48.425
and then you zeroed in
on those two digital collectibles.

19:48.505 --> 19:50.345
Your eyes were darting around
when you looked at Mr. Wen.

19:50.425 --> 19:53.385
Of course, I had to figure out
what I could do for you.

19:53.465 --> 19:54.905
Take a look. Is this useful?

19:54.985 --> 19:56.225
Decent.

19:56.985 --> 19:58.025
So,

19:58.665 --> 20:00.825
what did you do here all night?

20:01.625 --> 20:03.945
I also organized
all the new business cards you received.

20:04.545 --> 20:05.385
I jotted down notes

20:05.465 --> 20:07.145
on key conversation points
and general profiles of each person.

20:07.225 --> 20:09.305
I'll export them tonight
and send them to you.

20:09.385 --> 20:13.185
And I heard a lot of people talking
about dual carbon and green finance today.

20:13.265 --> 20:14.625
I think it's going to be a big trend.

20:14.705 --> 20:17.065
When I get back,
I'll do more research on that.

20:17.145 --> 20:19.665
You can maintain
such sharp business instincts

20:20.185 --> 20:22.105
in a social setting like this.

20:22.185 --> 20:23.905
There are not many girls like you around.

20:23.985 --> 20:26.345
I'm not here to see the world.

20:27.385 --> 20:29.465
I just want to become your trusted protege

20:30.065 --> 20:31.585
as quickly as possible.

20:32.865 --> 20:33.745
So, Master?

20:33.825 --> 20:35.745
Did I do okay today?

20:38.705 --> 20:39.545
Not quite yet.

20:40.745 --> 20:42.065
What did I miss?

20:42.145 --> 20:43.625
You're not relaxed enough.

20:43.705 --> 20:45.545
You've been holding that glass all day.

20:45.625 --> 20:46.785
Barely touched it.

20:47.385 --> 20:50.185
You told me not to drink at these events.

20:53.385 --> 20:54.585
Besides,

20:54.665 --> 20:55.505
I am here.

21:09.105 --> 21:10.385
We're too busy at work.

21:10.985 --> 21:11.985
Sometimes,

21:12.625 --> 21:13.505
you really should learn from me

21:14.225 --> 21:16.625
how to balance work and life.

21:18.225 --> 21:19.305
Here we go again.

22:55.865 --> 22:58.305
The research is about 60% complete.

22:58.385 --> 23:00.625
Next up are the key interviews
and modeling.

23:00.705 --> 23:04.025
Once those are done,
consultants like Cindy

23:04.105 --> 23:05.945
will each take charge
of analyzing one module.

23:06.025 --> 23:08.225
Then we get to the main event
of strategic consulting.

23:08.305 --> 23:10.025
The process doesn't matter.

23:10.105 --> 23:11.025
I only care about the results.

23:12.305 --> 23:13.505
By the way,

23:13.585 --> 23:14.905
I meant to ask you last time.

23:14.985 --> 23:17.385
Why isn't Lin Long
on this consulting team?

23:18.225 --> 23:20.585
Did she actually take my advice
and go on maternity leave?

23:24.065 --> 23:24.985
What's wrong?

23:26.585 --> 23:27.425
Something happened?

23:30.665 --> 23:31.505
Is it about the baby?

23:41.665 --> 23:43.025
She really went through it.

23:46.585 --> 23:47.585
How is she doing lately?

23:47.665 --> 23:48.865
Did you see her?

23:49.585 --> 23:51.625
She's okay. She's recovering.

23:57.785 --> 23:59.105
She's been through a lot lately.

23:59.185 --> 24:01.145
You seem to be doing
pretty well for yourself, though.

24:05.545 --> 24:07.505
Your boyfriend is quite handsome.

24:11.905 --> 24:13.465
He's not my boyfriend.
You've got it wrong.

24:13.545 --> 24:14.385
I get it.

24:14.945 --> 24:16.185
Girls are hard to read.

24:16.265 --> 24:17.665
-No… No.
-Well, good luck then.

24:17.745 --> 24:18.585
Hope you lock it down soon.

24:18.665 --> 24:20.785
He's really not my boyfriend.
He's my senior.

24:20.865 --> 24:21.865
Senior?

24:24.145 --> 24:26.305
You and your senior
were posing like this in the background?

24:28.225 --> 24:29.265
Next time, if you have
something like this…

24:29.345 --> 24:31.865
Mr. Shen, let's get back to work.

24:33.225 --> 24:34.065
Okay.

24:34.145 --> 24:35.425
I'll send you that photo later.

24:35.505 --> 24:36.545
You can run your own model.

24:36.625 --> 24:38.625
Check what the odds are
for the two of you.

24:39.505 --> 24:41.425
-Make a prediction.
-Mr. Shen…

24:48.785 --> 24:51.705
You told me not to drink at these events.

24:52.305 --> 24:54.865
I told you not to drink recklessly.

24:54.945 --> 24:56.145
Besides,

24:56.225 --> 24:57.345
I am here.

24:58.905 --> 24:59.945
I'm fine.

25:01.305 --> 25:03.545
Let me recite it for you. Three point
one four one five nine two six

25:03.625 --> 25:05.185
-three two three eight four six two…
-Stop reciting.

25:06.025 --> 25:07.105
Do it in the car.

25:48.745 --> 25:50.785
SAVE IMAGE

26:01.505 --> 26:03.745
Here's the research
on those investment funds you asked for.

26:03.825 --> 26:05.785
I've done it
on my personal computer as you requested.

26:06.545 --> 26:09.265
Right. Remember,
always keep the work I give you

26:09.345 --> 26:11.545
physically separate from Maxmise files.

26:11.625 --> 26:13.065
No problem.

26:13.145 --> 26:15.705
Even on my personal computer,
I've set up separate encryption.

26:16.425 --> 26:18.065
Oh, and one more thing.

26:18.145 --> 26:19.665
Some of the information

26:19.745 --> 26:21.545
on the Yuanke Factory
contact is not public.

26:21.625 --> 26:23.505
I have a colleague
I'm close with named Zhao Heng.

26:23.585 --> 26:26.505
He used to be that person's assistant
during his internship.

26:26.585 --> 26:27.945
So I asked him to help.

26:29.185 --> 26:30.225
Got it.

26:30.825 --> 26:31.825
I'll go through it when I get back.

26:31.905 --> 26:32.945
Okay.

26:33.665 --> 26:34.665
How are you holding up?

26:35.185 --> 26:36.785
Juggling work on both sides lately.

26:37.385 --> 26:38.505
Can you handle it?

26:41.625 --> 26:43.185
Barely.

26:43.265 --> 26:45.785
But I have to earn every penny
of the salary you pay me.

26:46.385 --> 26:47.785
Salary?

26:47.865 --> 26:48.785
It's just a red envelope.

26:49.785 --> 26:52.265
I'm just teaching you
some Spanish on the side,

26:52.345 --> 26:53.305
not hiring you for a part-time job.

26:56.025 --> 26:59.225
Hello. Thanks. Bye.

26:59.905 --> 27:00.745
Don't worry.

27:00.825 --> 27:02.705
That's what I tell people too.

27:09.785 --> 27:11.025
Hey, Ms. Sha.

27:12.905 --> 27:13.985
Yes.

27:14.065 --> 27:16.025
It's on my phone. I'll send it right away.

28:05.025 --> 28:06.185
You scumbag!

28:06.265 --> 28:08.585
If you never loved me,
why didn't you tell me sooner?

28:09.665 --> 28:10.585
I'm asking you a question!

28:10.665 --> 28:13.145
Why did you keep stringing me along
and giving me false hope?

28:14.305 --> 28:17.025
Why aren't TV crews camped out here?

28:17.105 --> 28:18.305
I mean, look at this place.

28:18.385 --> 28:22.225
Cheesy romance. Detective thrillers.
Rags to riches and riches to rags.

28:22.865 --> 28:24.665
So much material.

28:26.665 --> 28:27.745
What's wrong?

28:29.065 --> 28:30.985
Nothing. You can go.

28:37.345 --> 28:38.265
I'm off.

28:46.185 --> 28:47.465
I forgot to give you a few documents.

28:47.545 --> 28:49.425
The classification is too high.
Can't email them.

28:49.505 --> 28:51.745
Can you drop by my place
after work to pick them up?

28:51.825 --> 28:53.585
YE XINZHI

28:53.665 --> 28:54.785
Is 10:45 okay?

28:54.865 --> 28:55.705
XU CHI

28:55.785 --> 28:57.025
Okay.

28:59.545 --> 29:06.385
SONGFENG RESTAURANT

29:23.745 --> 29:26.025
That was fast.
I thought it was room service.

29:26.105 --> 29:26.985
Come in. I'll go get them.

29:28.625 --> 29:29.785
-I…
-It's fine.

29:29.865 --> 29:31.025
No need to change shoes.

29:32.345 --> 29:34.025
You haven't eaten this late?

29:44.545 --> 29:46.425
Where's the potted plant I bought you?

29:59.585 --> 30:01.985
The document and USB drive are all here.
Thanks for coming all this way.

30:03.745 --> 30:04.905
No worries.

30:04.985 --> 30:07.425
Thanks. Sorry to make
you come all this way at this hour.

30:11.105 --> 30:12.145
I'm off.

30:44.065 --> 30:45.465
Here is the document.
Here's the USB drive.

30:45.545 --> 30:46.865
Thanks for coming all this way.

31:21.705 --> 31:23.025
Xu Chi.

31:23.105 --> 31:24.785
You're an idiot!

31:28.145 --> 31:29.985
He definitely wanted you to see that.

31:32.705 --> 31:33.745
What are you looking at?

31:35.025 --> 31:36.425
I'm talking about you.

31:38.465 --> 31:39.905
You've been caught red-handed.

31:41.065 --> 31:42.545
Who are you?

31:42.625 --> 31:45.505
What right do you have to overthink this?

31:46.745 --> 31:47.905
Got humiliated, didn't you?

31:48.465 --> 31:49.505
Does it hurt?

31:50.585 --> 31:51.665
So stupid!

31:55.305 --> 31:56.745
Hey, neighbor! Are you okay?

31:57.825 --> 31:58.985
I'm fine!

31:59.505 --> 32:00.745
Sorry!

32:03.465 --> 32:04.865
So stupid!

32:09.425 --> 32:11.265
So cruel.

32:14.745 --> 32:16.785
If I hadn't known you for years,

32:16.865 --> 32:19.145
I wouldn't have helped you
with something this cruel.

32:19.225 --> 32:22.345
What are you doing,
making that poor girl so upset?

32:22.865 --> 32:26.825
Better she's heartbroken now
than later, right?

32:27.745 --> 32:28.865
Thank you for today.

32:28.945 --> 32:31.985
I don't know who else
I could've asked for this favor.

32:34.425 --> 32:35.905
Lucky I happened to come back
to the country recently.

32:36.425 --> 32:37.705
But

32:38.785 --> 32:39.745
Xiaoyezi,

32:39.825 --> 32:41.425
you've been single for so long.

32:41.505 --> 32:43.665
Maybe you could consider…

32:43.745 --> 32:44.945
I've tried before.

32:45.465 --> 32:47.305
But whenever I think
of what happened before,

32:47.825 --> 32:49.105
I can't bring myself to do it again.

32:50.465 --> 32:51.745
I'm too busy.

32:52.385 --> 32:53.945
I don't have the energy left to love.

32:54.945 --> 32:58.505
So some sparks
are better snuffed out early.

33:24.545 --> 33:25.625
Stay calm.

33:26.825 --> 33:28.305
The fact that he did that

33:29.345 --> 33:30.705
means there's still hope.

33:31.225 --> 33:32.385
Otherwise,

33:33.305 --> 33:35.185
he would've just quietly cut you loose.

33:40.305 --> 33:41.505
So wake up now

33:42.505 --> 33:46.825
while he's still giving you a chance.
Stop saving random photos.

33:47.425 --> 33:48.625
I need to go to the airport.

33:49.505 --> 33:53.185
Xiaoyezi. Remember to be kind
to yourself and to others.

33:54.945 --> 33:55.865
Bye.

33:56.545 --> 33:57.585
Thanks.

34:06.105 --> 34:07.385
Xu Chi.

34:07.465 --> 34:09.625
From now on, you focus only on your work.

34:10.545 --> 34:13.264
Your goals are your career
and your apartment, not men.

34:19.344 --> 34:20.865
DELETE

34:20.945 --> 34:23.105
CONFIRM DELETE SELECTED FILES
FROM LOCAL DRIVE? CANCEL / CONFIRM

34:24.865 --> 34:25.945
CONFIRM

35:11.945 --> 35:12.985
Still not awake?

35:13.585 --> 35:14.825
Or did you not sleep at all?

35:16.425 --> 35:17.545
I'm sorry.

35:18.065 --> 35:20.545
But it's for the best for both of us.

35:28.345 --> 35:29.385
Morning.

35:35.945 --> 35:37.065
A sweet night, right?

35:37.145 --> 35:39.185
Can't believe you're up so early.
Impressive.

35:40.145 --> 35:41.065
Take your time running, sir.

35:41.145 --> 35:42.745
I have already done two laps.

35:42.825 --> 35:44.225
I'm heading up.

36:28.345 --> 36:29.465
It's okay.

36:30.185 --> 36:32.305
You did great just now.

36:32.385 --> 36:33.865
Very natural.

36:49.545 --> 36:51.105
A sweet night, right?

36:51.185 --> 36:52.825
Can't believe you're up so early.
Impressive.

36:53.665 --> 36:55.025
"Can't believe you're up so early."

36:55.705 --> 36:56.665
Take your time running, sir.

36:56.745 --> 36:58.305
I have already done two laps.

36:58.385 --> 36:59.425
"Sir"?

37:02.785 --> 37:03.945
After all that,

37:04.985 --> 37:06.945
I was the one overthinking it.

37:27.065 --> 37:28.545
You're pretty free today.

37:29.785 --> 37:31.665
Thought you wouldn't
show up at the office.

37:34.225 --> 37:36.225
The interviews with Bolo Culture are done,

37:36.305 --> 37:37.785
and the initial model is built.

37:37.865 --> 37:39.465
Cindy and the others are reviewing it.

37:39.545 --> 37:40.865
I'm still new.

37:41.465 --> 37:43.785
I've done what I can.

37:43.865 --> 37:46.825
Just waiting for them
to reassign tasks now.

37:48.465 --> 37:49.545
Bored?

37:52.105 --> 37:52.945
A little.

37:54.305 --> 37:57.865
I was so pumped
when I landed this project.

37:57.945 --> 38:01.025
Felt like I was ready
to go all in for a year.

38:01.625 --> 38:05.265
Now, not even a third of the way in,
I'm already running out of steam.

38:05.345 --> 38:07.265
Not challenging enough?

38:07.345 --> 38:10.345
Consulting is a lot like art.

38:11.065 --> 38:13.945
We're all trying to shape something raw
into something refined.

38:14.545 --> 38:17.105
What consultants enjoy
is the creative process.

38:17.185 --> 38:19.625
You never know
how brilliant the result will be

38:19.705 --> 38:21.145
until you put down the final stroke.

38:22.185 --> 38:25.065
Bolo Culture just wants to use you
to get rid of people they don't want.

38:25.145 --> 38:28.625
So what if your proposal is flashy?

38:28.705 --> 38:30.105
You already know the ending.
There's no suspense.

38:30.785 --> 38:31.905
How do you know so much?

38:33.625 --> 38:36.465
I interned at Beisen's New York office
my sophomore year.

38:37.065 --> 38:39.825
I've led more projects
than the number of men you've dated.

38:41.145 --> 38:43.025
I've only had one ex-boyfriend. Thanks.

38:45.465 --> 38:46.665
Just one?

38:47.305 --> 38:48.225
I don't believe you.

38:50.345 --> 38:51.985
You dare let me check your phone?

38:53.585 --> 38:54.705
Check it then.

38:55.225 --> 38:56.065
Three, two, one.

38:56.985 --> 38:58.185
That confident?

39:08.025 --> 39:09.305
You slipped up.

39:09.385 --> 39:12.265
Recently deleted. Why did you delete it?

39:13.025 --> 39:13.865
Give it to me.

39:13.945 --> 39:14.825
-Why did you delete it?
-Give it…

39:15.705 --> 39:16.865
Guilty?

39:19.865 --> 39:21.625
Who's this guy?

39:24.705 --> 39:26.865
Isn't that the poser?

39:29.025 --> 39:31.425
I knew there was something
between you two.

39:31.505 --> 39:33.025
There's nothing between us.

39:33.105 --> 39:36.145
We're just master and protege.

39:36.985 --> 39:39.345
What is this, a TV drama?
Master and protege?

39:39.425 --> 39:40.545
Let me tell you.

39:40.625 --> 39:44.665
You're just a junior analyst at Maxmise.
He's a partner at C&amp;C.

39:44.745 --> 39:45.865
You two are this close.

39:45.945 --> 39:47.785
You should be thankful
no one's reporting you

39:47.865 --> 39:48.905
for corporate espionage.

39:48.985 --> 39:50.705
I know compliance. I…

39:52.345 --> 39:53.625
He's just teaching me Spanish.

39:54.985 --> 39:56.625
That's even worse.

39:56.705 --> 39:58.825
He's a handsome,
wealthy industry big shot.

39:58.905 --> 40:01.145
If he didn't want something from you,

40:01.225 --> 40:02.785
why would he be so nice

40:02.865 --> 40:05.545
as to teach you Spanish?

40:06.305 --> 40:09.665
You think you're some web novel heroine
who finds cheat codes everywhere?

40:11.385 --> 40:13.025
What could he possibly want from me?

40:15.265 --> 40:16.985
You're overthinking it.

40:17.945 --> 40:19.425
Just overthinking it.

40:21.985 --> 40:23.225
Overthinking it.

40:25.825 --> 40:27.145
What's going on?

40:28.865 --> 40:30.025
Wait, wait.

40:32.185 --> 40:33.225
What did I say?
